{"id":"u-8675053c-1a48-479a-9a3a-71715a267eb2","src":"community","title":"Beards Over Bars: Bench and Pull Ups (1)","author":"Joseph R.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/pEKzdK-beards-over-bars-bench-and-pull-ups-1","desc":"If you want to be good at something, you have to practice. In this 4-day program, you will practice bench press twice a week and pull ups twice a week through various methods. After your \"practice\", you will move on to your hypertrophy focused work. This program is heavily geared towards upper body, so don't dare skip the leg day or the lunges! The workout is written with simplicity in mind for the sake of the app and your freedom. Feel free to add variations to the exercises such as chains, bands, boards. Use your own judgment on reps/weights. If you want to do things a little differently than listed, do it! Lunges at the the end of the workout are mentioned to be bodyweight. I prefer the \"lunge and learn\" method coined by CoryGfitness. Turn on a motivational or educational video that last 5-15 minutes and do walking lunges till the video ends. While lunges are fire, I added some alternative ideas that you can use if you like.\n\n Most of all, have fun, enjoy life, and get jacked!","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Athletics","Strength","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-18T01:37:26.966Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":0,"x":4}]},{"n":"Wide Grip Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"rpe":5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"x":4}]},{"n":"Walking Lunge","sets":[{"sec":300,"secHi":1200}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Larsen Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"x":4}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":4}]},{"n":"Russian